{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794497479706992370,"compiled_state":{"alias":null,"assignee":null,"author":"reconciler","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":1,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"5f6367bc707afe1c1b650446e53a7ee4525b47f2f231c46550acf9ba46ff25db","event_uuid":"9d2f8408-ad6e-49df-a0b5-0a4802705ce8","position":{"commit_sha":"cb933506c0ff8c4c2c3b31ab4aec89d36f5f8e15","position":"1794497479706992369-9d2f8408-ad6e-49df-a0b5-0a4802705ce8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":"REB","claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794497479706992369,"creation_channel":"jira","deps":[],"description":"## Observation (read-only, 2026-11-12 ~05:55 PST)\nThe spend-cap Lambda (`/aws/lambda/bedrock-spend-cap` log, ticks from 13:41Z onward) reported the metered (ceiling-priced CloudWatch token) estimate at about 3 times the Cost Explorer figure for the same UTC day, with `effective_source=metered`. The metered arm crossed the daily threshold and attached `BedrockDailySpendCapDeny` (about 05:40 PST), denying `bedrock:InvokeModel` to every capped role, including rebar-gerrit-instance-role, until the 00:00 UTC release.\n\ninfra/terraform/bedrock-spend-cap/README.md documents the metered arm as an intentional upper bound, running at about 1.1 to 1.9 times settled billing. A ratio of about 3 is outside that band. Dollar figures are deliberately omitted (public tracker); they are in the Lambda log lines and Cost Explorer for 2026-11-12.\n\n## Hypotheses (unproven)\n- The model mix shifted (5.5 inference profiles since change 3340) so more tokens are priced at a ceiling well above their real rate.\n- Cost Explorer lags intra-day, so a same-day comparison overstates the ratio relative to the settled-day figure the README describes.\n- Cache-read tokens are priced at a ceiling far above the actual cache-read rate.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The ratio for 2026-11-12 is re-measured against the SETTLED Cost Explorer day, and the cause of any excess over the documented band is identified from the per-direction token counts.\n- [ ] Either the ceiling table is corrected or the README band is updated with the measured reason; no config key, env var or flag.","env_id":"reconciler","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["imported:reconciler-bootstrap"],"ticket_id":"jira-reb-7141","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Bedrock spend-cap metered estimate ran about 3x settled billing on 2026-11-12, above the README's documented band","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["9d2f8408-ad6e-49df-a0b5-0a4802705ce8"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794497479706992370,"uuid":"afc72120-37ad-441b-a86a-e05e02079102"}